    "description": "Ask\n\nReorder the Referral Information section per Emily's layout spec:\n\nRow 1: Referrer, Referral Type\n\nRow 2: Secondary Referrer (left), No Referrer (right)\n\nUpdate Log/Complete Screenflow field order to match.\n\nTarget\n\nObject: Sign_Up__c · Sign-Up record page / Log Sign Up layout\n\nDone when\n\nFields render in the positions above at all statuses where the section shows.\n\nExisting conditional logic preserved: No Referrer checked → Referrer, Referral Type, Payout Amount hide.\n\nOpen question (non-blocking)\n\nCounter-proposal — hide No Referrer when a Referrer is filled — was not addressed by Emily's layout spec. Include or drop?\n\nSource\n\nEmily doc comment 2026-08-28 (layout positions verbatim). [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LOMrG0-0JchyP9wHrV4hMlBqh-gMq8YxknpySd5OJjY/edit](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1LOMrG0-0JchyP9wHrV4hMlBqh-gMq8YxknpySd5OJjY/edit)",
