          "id": "10373",
          "body": "**Changes made:**\n\n**\\[Screen\\] - Sign Up - In Progress** (`Screen_Sign_Up_In_Progress`) — last saved 2026-09-01 5:05 PM UTC.\n\n* Reordered the Referral Information section to: Row 1 — Referrer, Referral Type; Row 2 — Secondary Referrer, Referral Notes (newly added to this section); Row 3 — No Referrer.\n* Payout Amount and Referrer Currency are not included in this layout, since both are system-calculated by another flow and not intended for user input.\n* Existing conditional logic preserved: No Referrer checked still hides Referrer, Referral Type, Secondary Referrer, and Referral Notes.\n* Counter-proposal from the ticket implemented, and extended: No Referrer now also hides when either Referrer or Secondary Referrer is filled in.\n\n**\\[Screen\\] - Sign Up - Complete** (`Screen_Sign_Up_Complete`) — last saved 2026-09-01 5:12 PM UTC.\n\n* Identical changes to the In Progress flow above (same 3-row layout, same fields, same conditional logic).\n\n**Sign_Up_Record_Page_v3** (Lightning Record Page)\n\n* Rearranged the Referral Information section fields to: Row 1 — Referrer, Referral Type; Row 2 — Secondary Referrer, Payout Amount; Row 3 — Referral Notes, Referrer Currency; Row 4 — No Referrer.\n* Note: this arrangement differs from the screen flow layout above (it includes Payout Amount and Referrer Currency, which the screen flows deliberately exclude).\n\n**Scope deviations from original spec (sign-off obtained from Kobi):**\n\n* Referral Notes was added into the Referral Information section on both screen flows; not part of the original spec.\n* Payout Amount and Referrer Currency were deliberately excluded from the screen flow layout (system-calculated, not user-editable) — not called out in the original 2-row spec.\n* The record page layout (4 rows, includes Payout Amount/Referrer Currency) does not match the screen flow layout (3 rows, excludes them).\n* The open counter-proposal (hide No Referrer when Referrer is filled) was implemented and extended to also trigger on Secondary Referrer — beyond the ticket's original open question.\n\n**Testing:** Tested in sandbox. All deviations above from Emily's original spec have been reviewed and approved by Kobi.",
          "created": "2026-09-01T13:48:12.155-0400",
          "updated": "2026-09-01T13:48:12.155-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        }
